  "custom_logic_notes": "MWMode feature: When enabled, SL/TP are set to 0 on order open, stored in global variables, then applied via PositionModify on next tick after position is detected. This is a workaround for brokers requiring zero SL/TP on open. SL is clamped: Buy SL min = Bid - Point*(Spread+StopsLevel+1), Sell SL min = Ask + Point*(Spread+StopsLevel+1). RevClose parameter allows opposite signal to close existing position. CommonShift adds a uniform offset to all indicator shift parameters. ZeroBar flag allows trading on bar 0 if any shift resolves to 0.",
